/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[46]+ <-> Tenth[46]+ (record
goctad:E33@T32+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGoctadE33T32pHX` and `wGoctadE33T32pGX` (divided by
`2 ^ 37` and `2 ^ 13`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per
column; the parts evaluate no word image. -/

